I got an answer for that.
I resolved link error by installing binutils-gold.
Try the below command.

apt-get install binutils-gold

I found this information from the below link.
http://stackoverflow.com/questions/7773811/gcc-compile-has-undefined-references-despite-previously-functional-linking-ubunt

